{# Written into every backup this role takes, at mode 0600 under no_log, and it
   is deliberately a document rather than a machine format. What reads it is an
   operator holding a backup directory and no repository, so it says what is in
   the directory, what is NOT, and what to do with it -- beside the bytes rather
   than in a document somewhere else.

   It carries no credential of its own. The dump beside it carries several,
   which is what the closing paragraph is about and why the whole backup root is
   mode 0700. #}
